Error [E0003]: `..` must be the last entry of a list pattern
  --> tests/ui/pattern_ratified_list_rest_not_last.jet:3:24
    |
  3 |   if values == [first, ..rest, last] -> print(first)
    |                        ^^^^^^
 Why: `..` stands for everything the pattern does not list, so nothing can follow it
 Fix: Move `..` to the end of the pattern
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
